abstract: >-
  Lean-checked unimodality of the independence sequence for every finite
  simple forest with at most 37 vertices. The full proof and concrete Mathlib
  corollary use a reviewed custom kernel-assembly and reimport workflow.
  A separate 116-module general library passed an ordinary Lake build.
  A fresh full exported-source rebuild and ordinary full final-source
  elaboration have not been completed. This is a finite result, not a proof
  of unrestricted Erdos 993.
